  <tag code="12.5" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">12.5 - By 2030, substantially reduce waste generation through prevention, reduction, recycling and reuse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">12.5 - Till 2030 v&#xE4;sentligt minska m&#xE4;ngden avfall genom &#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rebygga, minska, &#xE5;teranv&#xE4;nda och &#xE5;tervinna avfall.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="13.2" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">13.2 - Integrate climate change measures into national policies, strategies and planning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">13.2 - Integrera klimat&#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder i politik, strategier och planering p&#xE5; nationell niv&#xE5;.</narrative>
  </tag>
  <tag code="6.5" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6.5 - By 2030, implement integrated water resources management at all levels, including through transboundary cooperation as appropriate.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">6.5 - Senast 2030 genomf&#xF6;ra en integrerad f&#xF6;rvaltning av vattenresurser p&#xE5; alla niv&#xE5;er, n&#xE4;r s&#xE5; &#xE4;r l&#xE4;mpligt genom gr&#xE4;ns&#xF6;verskridande samarbete.</narrative>
  </tag>
